  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mahanga ga kūbagema Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mahanga aya hū gene ayo akagaleka ū SEEBA kūlwa kūbagema a Baisilaeli a bose abo baalī batabūlwile ū būlūgū wa mu sī ya Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ū gwenūyo akagwīta kūlwa kūbalanga dūhū a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha Baisilaeli abo baalī batabītile mu būlūgū; nabo bīībītīle ī mihayo ya būlūgū.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mahanga genayo gaalī aya, sī ya basugi bataano ba Bafilisiti, pye a Bakanaani, Basidoni, Bahīvī abo biikalaga kū ngūlū ja Lebanoni, kūfuma kū lūgūlū lwa Baali-helimoni kūshisha kū nzīla ya Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mahanga genaya gakalekwa kūlwa kūbagema a Baisilaeli, kūbabona ūlū bakūbiza biigwi ū kū shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, īsho walī wabinha bakūlūgenji babo mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli biikala hamò nabo a banhū ba mahanga ga Bakanaani, Bahītī, Baamooli, Bapelizi, Bahīvī, na a Bayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bashīke babo būyūbatoola, na a boi būyūbazunīlīja a bashīke babo kūtoolwa na a basūmba ba mu mahanga genayo; hama na a baamulungu babo būyūbatūmamīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Osinieli kūbaguna Baisilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bakīīta yabūbi ū miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, nguno bakang'wīība ū SEEBA Mulungu wabo, bandya kūgalamya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūgalamya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūgatūmamīla.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maabaalī na Maashela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū būpelanu o ng'wa SEEBA būbapembekela no nīyo a Baisilaeli, ūbajinja mu nkono gwa ntemi Kushani-lishasaimu, wa Mesopotamia;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mesopotamia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ipandī lya Sukuma ng'weli ya Mesopotamia, nūūlū Alamu-nahalaimu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wandya kūbaluhya a Baisilaeli kūshisha ikanza lya myaka īnaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho baanīlīīla ū SEEBA, ūbabūūkīja ngunanhi: Osinieli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kenazi, nzunaye o ng'wa Kelebu; ū munhū ng'wenūyo hū ūbapīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA akang'wikīīla, ūbiza namuji,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Namuji:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ntongeeji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wabo a Baisilaeli; ūja na kwilwisha būlūgū nū ntemi Kushani-lishasaimu wa Mesopotamia. Ū SEEBA ūntūūla ū ntemi Kushani-lishasaimu mu nkono gwakwe ū Osinieli, ūng'heeba kībi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī yūbiza mu mhola ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè, kūshisha ūcha ū Osinieli ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kenazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ehudi ngunanhi kūfuma kū Bamoabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bīīta yabūbi hangī ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, aho bīīta ū būbi wenūbo, ū SEEBA ūng'winha nguzu ntemi Eguloni wa Moabu, ja kūbaheeba a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ng'wenūyo ūbalaalīka Baamoni na Baamaleki, hūna ūja kūbadumīla a Baisilaeli, būgūsola ū nzengo gwa mitende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būsugwa na ntemi Eguloni wa Moabu ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na īnaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Baisilaeli aho baanīlīīla hangī ū SEEBA, ūbabūūkīja ngunanhi, Ehudi; munhū wa lūmoso, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Gela wa lūganda lwa Benjamini. A Baisilaeli būntūma ū Ehudi kūja na banhū ī ng'wa Eguloni ū ntemi wa Moabu, kūtwaala goodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ehudi walī wabeeja lūshū lwa būlīhu wa kūbiza gītī fuuti īmò na nusu. Ū lūshū lwenūlo ūlūtunga mu nkīmbīlī lūnungeela hitango lya kūgūlū gwa būlyo, hūna ūlūkundīkīja shizwalo īsho walī azwaalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika a ha ng'wa ntemi wa Moabu ū Eguloni, ūng'winha ī goodi. Ū ntemi ng'wenūyo walī ngīnu no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ehudi aho wamala ū kūfunya ī goodi, ūbalaga a biye abo walī wiza nabo bībūkije ī goodi, būja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei ūshokanya aho washika bbihī na Giligaali, gaalī hoi maashiikolile ga kūlamiwa; ūshika ūng'wīla, “Baba ntemi, nalī na kamhayo kaakūkūwīla tūlī babīlī dūhū.” Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Lembeeshaga taame!” Hūna a batūmami bakwe būfuma mo pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Ehudi wegeela aho walī wigaasha ū ntemi iyene mu chumba sha kū golofa sha kwifuulīla makanza ga līīmi ūlū lyasebaga; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Nalī na mhayo nakwenhelaga, naatūmagwa na Mulungu.” Ū ntemi aho wihamba kūbūūka a hisumbī lyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Ehudi ūgoloola ū nkono gwakwe gwa lūmoso, ūlūsopoola ū lūshū ū kūfuma ū kwitango lya kū būlyo, ūnchima ū ntemi lwa munda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūūlibīla pyī nī shipīndī shaalo, lūūkapulung'hanya na kū ngongo. Ū Ehudi ūlūleka haaho nguno lūkalung'wa masaasa, būpuluka na būsoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ehudi ūfuma hanze kwibīndo, wīlugala ī milyango ya chumba sha kū golofa, ūnugalīla ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wīnga ū Ehudi, a batūmami ba ntemi biiza kūlola; aho bīībona ī milyango ya kū chumba sha kū golofa īlugalilwe, būhaya gīkī, “Mmho ū ntemi wifuulaga kū chumba sha mu gatī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūlindīīla kūshisha nose būzwangana, aho baabona wadīīla no no no ū kwīlugūla ī milyango, būsola lūfungūlo būlugūla; būūkang'wipuumūkīja ū saabo būgonzo alambalalile hasī achiile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya kūlindīīla lyenīlo, ū Ehudi ūhega ajile; ūūkabīta ho a ha maashiikolile ga kūlamiwa, ūpeelela Seila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshika kwenūko ūja kū ngūlū ja Efulaimu ūūkafuula mhembe; hūna a Baisilaeli būholomoka kūfuma ū kū ngūlū balīnkūūbīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Nilondeelagi nguno ū SEEBA wītūūlaga mu makono ging'we ī Moabu ya banishi bing'we.” Ng'hana būnondeela, bika bajile kū mongo gwa Yolodani, būūkadima a ha būkīlīlo wa mongo, a hipandī lya kwingīlīla mu Moabu. Batazunīlīgije nūūlū ūmò ū kūkīlīla a henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būbabūlaga Bamoabu, bagosha ba mbagashūūla, ba kūshika gītī shihūmbī ikūmi; atapūlūgūkile nūūlū ūmò yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo a Baisilaeli bīsuga ī Moabu, ī sī yifuula ikanza lya myaka makūmi anaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shamga kūbapīja kūfuma kū Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
